# Probe: input signature fidelity

## Inner scope with its own required input

```catala
declaration scope Inner:
  input threshold content money
  output flag content boolean

scope Inner:
  definition flag equals threshold > $100
```

## Outer scope: context var, input var, and a subscope

```catala
declaration scope Outer:
  input salary content money
  context rate content decimal
  internal hidden content integer
  sub scope Inner
  output result content money

scope Outer:
  definition rate equals 10%
  definition hidden equals 42
  definition sub.threshold equals salary
  definition result equals salary * rate
```
